; WOLF 2 (Creature Lab v2, 9 Oct 2026; PLAN_V2.md part F, Ramon's walkthrough item 3): a fork of LabKit/carried/Model/wolf.tscn, which stays as it was.
; Changed: the rump back (Rump z -0.44 to -0.48, Loin -0.22 to -0.25) and the hind legs forward on it (HindHip z 0.02 to 0.07); the hind hips
; apart (x 0.085 to 0.105, radius 0.1 to 0.092: the pair overlapped by 3 cm); the head up a little (Ruff, Skull, Muzzle, Nose); the eyes
; bigger, black, and out past the skin of the head (they sat inside it).

